Description: Builds interactive 'shiny' dashboards for reporting
    population-level cancer statistics. A guided interface loads cancer
    incidence, mortality and population data, calculates counts,
    age-standardised rates, trends and lifetime risk, applies small-number
    suppression, and generates a dashboard application that is ready to
    publish.
